#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Toggle the Claude model-routing profile on or off.

on      install the routed subagents (Haiku: Explore, log-reader; Opus: deep-reasoner)
        and set the default model to `opusplan` (Opus plans, Sonnet executes) at
        effort `high`
off     remove exactly what `on` installed and restore the previous model/effort
status  show whether the profile is active

Guarantees:
- Only the settings keys listed in PROFILE_SETTINGS and the agent files this tool
  installed are ever changed. settings.json is re-serialised with 2-space indent.
- A value you changed while the profile was ON is kept on `off`, with a warning.
- An agent file you edited while the profile was ON is left in place on `off`.
- A failed `on` is rolled back completely.
- Concurrent runs are rejected by a file lock.
"""

